        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The best thing I can say about “Shifting Gears,” ABC’s new Tim Allen-rants-about-woke-stuff-he-hates sit-com, is that I thought it would be a lot worse than it is.",
          "block_bbox": [
            1233,
            6427,
            2176,
            6727
