        {
          "block_label": "vision_footnote",
          "block_content": "Tim Allen is Matt, a widower and owner of a classic car restoration shop, who gets a brave new reality when his daughter Riley (Kat Dennings) is forced to move back home with her two kids. PROVIDED BY MIKE TAING/DISNEY",
          "block_bbox": [
